# Service Provider Portal

A full-stack MERN application that helps service providers register, upload their documents, and get approved by an admin before accessing the platform.

## Features

### Authentication
- User registration
- User login with JWT authentication
- Role-based access (Provider & Admin)

### Provider
- Complete profile creation
- Upload profile photo
- Upload Aadhaar
- Upload PAN
- Upload experience certificate
- Edit profile before approval
- Track approval status
- Approved profiles become read-only

### Admin
- Admin login
- Dashboard with provider statistics
- View all registered providers
- Search and filter providers
- Approve or reject provider applications
- View uploaded documents

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- React Router
- Tailwind CSS
- Axios

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- JWT Authentication
- Multer

